OL,3,GNEWSA'Our dream to join Dosanjh on
OL,4,Astage came true'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple who were picked out to join
OL,7,FPunjabi singing star Diljit Dosanjh on
OL,8,Fstage at his Birmingham show have
OL,9,Fdescribed it as a dream come true.
OL,11,FFans Ravneet and Pritpal Mann from
OL,12,FWolverhampton said they "caught his
OL,13,Feye" and ended up meeting him and
OL,14,Fjoining in with the dancing at the
OL,15,FUtilita gig on Friday.
OL,17,F"This is what cloud nine must feel
OL,18,Flike," Pritpal said of the experience,
OL,19,Fwhich was captured on film by family
OL,20,Fmembers.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
